    "id": "tu-planning",
    "titulo": "El día de Adri",
    "html": "<section id=\"tu-planning\" style=\"background:#FAF6EE;color:#211714;font-family:Figtree, Arial, sans-serif;padding:86px 128px 140px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:40px\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\"><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">Tu planning · 14:40–16:50</p><h2 style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:58px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-1.5px\">El día de Adri, hora a hora</h2></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 360px 560px;gap:20px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:2px solid #211714\"><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">Hora</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">Qué grabas</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">Dónde</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B5F58\">Ten en cuenta</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 360px 560px;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:13px 10px;margin:0 -10px;border-bottom:1.5px solid #E2DBD0;\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">14:40</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.25\">Llegada · V2 · Ingredientes súper</p><p style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#4A3F3A\">Carrefour, pasillo de snacks</p><p style=\"font-size:19px;line-height:1.35;color:#4A3F3A\">El V2 entero, siempre en movimiento. En la misma visita, la estantería del V3.</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 360px 560px;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:13px 10px;margin:0 -10px;border-bottom:1.5px solid #E2DBD0;\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">15:25</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.25\">V3 · Esto es pollo, pero esto también lo es</p><p style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#4A3F3A\">Despacho</p><p style=\"font-size:19px;line-height:1.35;color:#4A3F3A\">Con Zara. Todo lo que va a cámara.</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 360px 560px;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:13px 10px;margin:0 -10px;border-bottom:1.5px solid #E2DBD0;\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">15:25</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.25\">V4 · Cereales vs snack dental</p><p style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#4A3F3A\">Despacho</p><p style=\"font-size:19px;line-height:1.35;color:#4A3F3A\">Con Zara. Mismo set, seguido al V3.</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 360px 560px;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:13px 10px;margin:0 -10px;border-bottom:1.5px solid #E2DBD0;\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">16:05</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.25\">V5 · Tierlist</p><p style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#4A3F3A\">Salón, sofá blanco</p><p style=\"font-size:19px;line-height:1.35;color:#4A3F3A\">Con Zara y los cinco mordedores. Zara siempre supervisada.</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 360px 560px;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:13px 10px;margin:0 -10px;border-bottom:1.5px solid #E2DBD0;\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">16:30</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.25\">V10 · Fake podcast</p><p style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#4A3F3A\">Salón</p><p style=\"font-size:19px;line-height:1.35;color:#4A3F3A\">Con Andrea y Zara. Micros a la vista.</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 360px 560px;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;padding:13px 10px;margin:0 -10px;border-bottom:1.5px solid #E2DBD0;background:#F1ECE3;\"><p style=\"font-family:'Titan One', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;font-size:24px\">16:50</p><p style=\"font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.25\">Fin</p><p style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#4A3F3A\"></p><p style=\"font-size:19px;line-height:1.35;color:#4A3F3A\"></p></div></div><img src=\"/pitch/barkita/logo-h-cacao.png\" alt=\"Barkita\" style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;bottom:66px;width:150px;height:24px;object-fit:contain\"><p style=\"position:absolute;left:300px;bottom:62px;width:1100px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;color:#6B5F58\"></p><p style=\"position:absolute;right:128px;bottom:62px;width:120px;text-align:right;font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2\">03</p></section>"
